## Quick Start

### Prerequisites

| Requirement | Version | Purpose |
|:------------|:--------|:--------|
| Python | 3.10+ | Robot daemon, tools, AI |
| Node.js | 18+ | Web console, TypeScript |
| Rust | 1.70+ | Anchor programs (optional) |
| Solana CLI | Latest | Blockchain interaction |

### Installation

```bash
# Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/8bitsats/Solana-Robotics-Kit.git
cd Solana-Robotics-Kit

# Run automated setup
./scripts/setup.sh

# Or install manually
pip install -e ".[dev]"
```

### Start the Operator Console

```bash
cd solana-robotics-kit-v0.4/apps/operator_console
cp .env.local.example .env.local
npm install && npm run dev
```

Open **http://localhost:3000** to access the dashboard.

### Run a Robot Daemon

```bash
python -m apps.robot_daemon.main \
  --task-runner \
  --capabilities navigation,delivery \
  --poll-s 5
```

### Token Operations

```bash
# Check token info
python -m packages.kit_token.cli info

# Check balance
python -m packages.kit_token.cli balance

# Stake for robot registration
python -m packages.kit_token.cli stake ROBOT-001 --tier basic
```

---

## Architecture

### Scalable Design

Built for **1,000+ developers** with:
- **Modular packages** - Clear separation of concerns
- **Clear navigation** - Easy to find components
- **Developer-friendly** - Clear entry points and docs
- **Professional structure** - Industry-standard organization

### System Layers

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                              APPLICATION LAYER                                       │
│  ┌──────────────────┐  ┌──────────────────┐  ┌──────────────────┐                   │
│  │  Operator        │  │  Robot           │  │  Vibe to Earn    │                   │
│  │  Console (Next)  │  │  Daemon (Python) │  │  API (FastAPI)   │                   │
│  └──────────────────┘  └──────────────────┘  └──────────────────┘                   │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                                AI LAYER                                              │
│  ┌──────────────────┐  ┌──────────────────┐  ┌──────────────────┐                   │
│  │  NVIDIA Cosmos   │  │  NVIDIA Nemotron │  │  OpenAI/         │                   │
│  │  (Perception)    │  │  (Reasoning)     │  │  Anthropic       │                   │
│  └──────────────────┘  └──────────────────┘  └──────────────────┘                   │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                             BLOCKCHAIN LAYER                                         │
│  ┌──────────────────┐  ┌──────────────────┐  ┌──────────────────┐  ┌─────────────┐  │
│  │  Robot           │  │  Task            │  │  Action          │  │  $KIT       │  │
│  │  Registry        │  │  Marketplace     │  │  Log             │  │  Token      │  │
│  └──────────────────┘  └──────────────────┘  └──────────────────┘  └─────────────┘  │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                              HARDWARE LAYER                                          │
│  ┌──────────────────┐  ┌──────────────────┐  ┌──────────────────┐                   │
│  │  NVIDIA Jetson   │  │  Sensors         │  │  Actuators       │                   │
│  │  Orin Nano       │  │  (LiDAR, Camera) │  │  (Motors, Arms)  │                   │
│  └──────────────────┘  └──────────────────┘  └──────────────────┘                   │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### Core Packages

| Package | Description | Location |
|:--------|:------------|:---------|
| **kit-token** | Token integration & x402 protocol | `packages/kit-token/` |
| **solana-client** | Python blockchain client | `packages/solana-client/` |
| **vibe-to-earn** | Developer rewards platform | `packages/vibe-to-earn/` |
| **robot-passport** | NFT identity generator | `packages/robot-passport/` |
| **voice-synthesis** | OpenVoice + MeloTTS | `packages/voice-synthesis/` |
| **perception** | NVIDIA Cosmos integration | `packages/perception/` |
| **planning** | Hybrid planning algorithms | `packages/planning/` |
| **blender-assets** | 3D asset generator | `packages/blender-assets/` |
| **nim-client** | NVIDIA NIM integration | `packages/nim-client/` |

